* row 0 of A, staircase starts tick 5
Vah00_0 ah00[0] 0 PWL(0 0 36n 0 36.1n 1.8 46n 1.8 46.1n 0)
Vah00_1 ah00[1] 0 PWL(0 0 36n 0 36.1n 1.8 56n 1.8 56.1n 0)
