Vah10_6 ah10[6] 0 0
Vah10_7 ah10[7] 0 0
* column 0 of B, staircase starts tick 5
Vbv00_0 bv00[0] 0 PWL(0 0 46n 0 46.1n 1.8 56n 1.8 56.1n 0)
Vbv00_1 bv00[1] 0 PWL(0 0 36n 0 36.1n 1.8 56n 1.8 56.1n 0)
