* column 1 of B, staircase starts tick 6
Vbv01_0 bv01[0] 0 PWL(0 0 46n 0 46.1n 1.8 66n 1.8 66.1n 0)
Vbv01_1 bv01[1] 0 0
Vbv01_2 bv01[2] 0 PWL(0 0 56n 0 56.1n 1.8 66n 1.8 66.1n 0)
Vbv01_3 bv01[3] 0 0
Vbv01_4 bv01[4] 0 0
Vbv01_5 bv01[5] 0 0
Vbv01_6 bv01[6] 0 0
Vbv01_7 bv01[7] 0 0
